  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based in poor regions of Bangladesh and Nepal, the two organisations work with health care of poor women and children. Through the project, the partners aim to share knowledge from one country to another to enhance their capacity within this field. The focus of the project is to improved maternal and neonatal health care, through improved nutrition and structures related to this. Bangladesh, Nepal.</narrative>
  </description>
